               <geogName xml:id="geogName_id5100deea"/>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_id07cdbfaa">
               <p xml:id="idm154">During the summer of 1857 August Bournonville got the idea for the ballet "Adriana", which should take place in sixteenth-century Venice. He worked on the music with Gade from October 1857 to March 1858. In August that year Bournonville tried to persuade Gade to start working on the music again, but for unknown reasons the ballet was never finished.</p>
            </history>
